<title>USA: Florida $250 mln GO Education bonds won by Merrill.</title>
<headline>Florida $250 mln GO Education bonds won by Merrill.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch &amp; Co said Thursday it won $250 million of general obligation State Board of Education public education capital outlay bonds, with a true interest cost (TIC) of 5.571 percent.</p>
</text>
